<title>PORTUGAL: Avg yld 5.79 pct on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Avg yld 5.79 pct on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management auction of five-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY:23/3/2002</p>
<p>AMOUNT PLACED: 10.11 billion escudos  COUPON: 5.75</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.79365</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 5.81  LOWEST: 5.78</p>
<p>    BIDS: 52.195 billion    PAYMENT FREQUENCY: Annual</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 70.8 billion the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
</text>
